# Vercel React best practices

For any task in this repo that involves writing, reviewing, refactoring, or optimizing React/Next.js code (components, pages, data fetching, bundles, rendering):

1. **Read and follow** the `vercel-react-best-practices` skill before implementing.
2. Prefer its guidance over ad-hoc patterns when they conflict.
3. Apply high-impact categories first (waterfalls, bundle size, server performance) when relevant.
